@startuml post-manager-coffee-chat-notification-log-pk-delivery-lookup
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title POST /api/manager/v1/coffee-chat/notification-log/{pk}/delivery-lookup
caption CRB-77 · 어드민이 알림톡 한 건의 카카오 최종 결과를 알리고에서 바로 조회 (어드민 화면의 "알리고 결과 조회" 버튼)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ParseUUIDPipe" as Pipe
participant "ManagerCoffeeChatController" as Controller
participant "ManagerCoffeeChatService" as Service
participant "AdminNotificationLogRepository" as LogRepository
participant "NotificationDeliverySyncService" as SyncService
participant "AlimtalkService" as Alimtalk
participant "NotificationLogRepository" as NotificationLogRepository
database PostgreSQL
participant "Aligo"

Client -> Guard: POST /api/manager/v1/coffee-chat/notification-log/{pk}/delivery-lookup\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt pk가 UUID가 아님
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 Validation failed (uuid is expected)
end
Pipe -> Controller: lookupDelivery(pk)
Controller -> Service: lookupDelivery(pk)
Service -> LogRepository: findByPk(pk)
LogRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM notification_log WHERE pk = ?
PostgreSQL --> LogRepository: row | 없음
LogRepository --> Service: log | null
alt 없는 로그
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Notification log not found.
end
alt channel != kakao_alimtalk 또는 status != sent 또는 provider_message_id 없음
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 400 Only alimtalk accepted by Aligo has a delivery result.
end

Service -> SyncService: refresh(pk, provider_message_id)
SyncService -> Alimtalk: fetchResult(mid)
Alimtalk -> Aligo: POST https://kakaoapi.aligo.in/akv10/history/detail/ (apikey, userid, mid)
Aligo --> Alimtalk: { code, message, list: [{ msgid, rslt, rslt_message, rsltdate, ... }] }
note right of Alimtalk: 해석 규칙은 flow/notification-delivery-sync.puml과 같음
Alimtalk --> SyncService: delivered | failed | pending | error
opt delivered · failed
  SyncService -> NotificationLogRepository: updateDelivery(pk, ...)
  NotificationLogRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE notification_log SET delivery_status, delivery_code,\ndelivery_message, delivery_reported_at, delivery_next_check_at = NULL WHERE pk = ?
  note right
    스케줄러와 같은 저장. 결과가 확정돼 스케줄러는 더 조회하지 않음.
    운영자가 보고 있으므로 Slack으로 알리지 않음
  end note
end
note over SyncService: pending · error는 아무것도 바꾸지 않음 (스케줄러가 하던 대로 계속 조회)
SyncService --> Service: delivery

alt error (HTTP 오류 · JSON 아님 · code != 0 · 타임아웃 · 키 미설정)
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 502 Failed to fetch the result from Aligo: <사유, 이메일 · 전화번호 가림>
end
Service -> LogRepository: findByPk(pk)
LogRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM notification_log WHERE pk = ?
LogRepository --> Service: 조회 뒤의 log
note right of Service
  recipient는 응답에 넣지 않음.
  error · delivery_message는 이메일 · 전화번호를 가려서 응답 (maskPersonalInfo)
end note
Service --> Controller: NotificationDeliveryLookupDto
Controller --> Client: 200 { lookup: delivered | failed | pending, log: { pk, coffee_chat_request_pk, event, channel, status, error, provider_message_id, delivery_status, delivery_code, delivery_message, delivery_reported_at, attempt, next_retry_at, created_at } }

@enduml
